OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and settled to start the
OL,6,Fnew week with light winds. Sunny
OL,7,Fspells for many, though these may turn
OL,8,Fhazy at times as areas of cloud drift
OL,9,Fthrough.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSome late brightness to end
OL,12,FMonday, then clear spells and variable
OL,13,Fcloud overnight. Staying dry
OL,14,Fthroughout. Rather warm in urban areas
OL,15,Fbut fresher in rural locations.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FAnother fine and dry day with
OL,18,Fplenty of strong sunshine across the
OL,19,Fregion. Slightly breezier than Monday
OL,20,Fbut still warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
